Anatomy kit reference for the machine models.

Repository: https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy
Commit:     1482e84
Licence:    MIT, copied verbatim to LICENSE-anatomy in this directory

Used as reference:
  kit/iso-kit.mjs   the four side-shade buckets at the default view, the bevel
                    and rounded-plan proportions, and the dial and knurl layouts
  kit/iso.css       the light theme palette (values only, used by the sheet)

The models are 3D meshes built in src/mesh.rs and src/parts.rs. The kit's 2D
projection, painter rules and outline runs are not used: the renderer projects,
shades and outlines the 3D models (contract v2). The models under src/models are
original, and their proportions follow the assembler and crate references in the
user's earlier explorations.
